cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use iso20022-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "iso20022-mcp: Unified Model Context Protocol gateway for ISO 20022"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server that routes one small set of meta-tools
  (search, describe, validate, generate, parse) across the ISO 20022 pain,
  pacs, camt and acmt message families to their dedicated servers, so an
  AI agent installs one thing and discovers the whole suite.
authors:
